                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Identity_1.20.0"&gt;Azure.Identity_1.20.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.20.0 (2026-03-30)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added a JSON schema segment to the NuGet package that provides IntelliSense and validation for Azure.Identity credential configuration in &lt;code&gt;appsettings.json&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;AddAzureClient&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AddKeyedAzureClient&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;WithAzureCredential&lt;/code&gt; return type changed from &lt;code&gt;IHostApplicationBuilder&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;IClientBuilder&lt;/code&gt; to align with the &lt;code&gt;IClientBuilder&lt;/code&gt; composition change in System.ClientModel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
